        "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899090/extras/497eea4c1c20e5d19175d6d24b90b1af.avif?t=1761059127\" width=512 height=64 /></span><br>This pencil puzzle involves filling in the blanks with numbers 1 - 9 to match the numbers in the problem squares. Enjoy the light-hearted effects and have fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899090/extras/f09d6b67d1698da3fc3d9a6cf3622e26.avif?t=1761059127\" width=512 height=160 /></span><br>A: A row of confirmed numbers<br>B: Temporary numbers<br>C: Numbers not yet confirmed<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899090/extras/1e9a89383ddeb3a49398272878df2b35.avif?t=1761059127\" width=512 height=560 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Among the connected blocks there are numbers up to  1-9. The same numbers do not enter.<br></li><li>The same number can be entered for blocks interrupted by hint blocks.<br></li><li>If you put numbers in all blocks except hint block, it is clear!</li></ul>",
